OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust seeks #8m bailout
OL,4,Ato tackle deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust is seeking an #8m
OL,7,Fsupport package from NHS England to
OL,8,Fhelp tackle a growing deficit and
OL,9,Fdeliver planned savings, a meeting has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe York and Scarborough Teaching
OL,13,FHospitals NHS Foundation Trust reported
OL,14,Fan adjusted deficit of #18.4m at the
OL,15,Fhalfway point of the financial year,
OL,16,Fabout #9.2m behind its planned
OL,17,Fposition.
OL,19,FFor the full year, the organisation was
OL,20,Fforecasting a deficit of #30.5m under
OL,21,Fits mid-range scenario and #45.5m under
OL,22,Fits worst-case scenario.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
