OL,4,Ato tackle deficit
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, enough schemes had been
OL,7,Fidentified on paper to meet savings
OL,8,Ftargets, the trust's finance director,
OL,9,FAndrew Bertram, told a board meeting
OL,10,Flast week.
